Requirements for the scheme program:
- Target runtime: CHICKEN Scheme 5.3, run as `csi -script reduced_row_echelon_form.scm`.
- Begin the file with `(import scheme (chicken base) (chicken io))`; add other `(chicken â€¦)` modules if needed.
